{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o067a","title":"刘备东征拒绝孙权请和","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o067a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备因孙权袭关羽而东征，秋七月率军伐吴，拒绝孙权来书请和。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o067a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"出征拒和","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o067a-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"求和","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o067a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":221,"label":"章武元年秋七月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y221","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o065","basis":"章武元年秋七月"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o067a-q","xianzhu-q-o065","xianzhu-q-b-7396ee3085c96d5be06c"]},"source_order":[32,401,"O067a"],"order":6608}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o067a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-f54e9d2c0e7f626f5702","layer":"original","quote":"初，先主忿孙权之袭关羽，将东征。秋七月，遂帅诸军伐吴。孙权遣书请和，先主盛怒不许。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-7396ee3085c96d5be06c","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-7396ee3085c96d5be06c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖22〗建安二十六年：公元 221 年。建安年号到二十四年为止。刘备不承认曹魏的年号，所以继续以建安年号记年。丙午：阴历初六日。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":380,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dce0e27ac9260548c4b5","start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o065","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-3ec28bd830861da89fc0","layer":"original","quote":"即皇帝位于成都武担之南〖21〗，﹝一﹞为文曰：“惟建安二十六年四月丙午〖22〗，皇帝〔臣〕备，敢用玄牡〖23〗，昭告皇天上帝、后土神祇：汉有天下，历数无疆。曩者王莽篡盗〖24〗，光武皇帝震怒致诛，社稷复存。今曹操阻兵安忍〖25〗，戮杀主后；滔天泯夏〖26〗，罔顾天显〖27〗。操子丕，载其凶逆〖28〗，窃居神器。群臣将士以为社稷坠废，备宜修之；嗣武二祖〖29〗，龚行天罚。备惟否德〖30〗，惧忝帝位〖31〗；询于庶民，外及蛮夷君长，佥曰：‘天命不可以不答，祖业不可以久替，四海不可以无主；率土式望〖32〗，在备一人。’备畏天明命，又惧汉阼将湮于地；谨择元日〖33〗，与百僚登坛，受皇帝玺绶；修燔瘗〖34〗，告类于大神〖35〗。惟神〔尚〕飨〖36〗！祚于汉家，永绥四海〖37〗！”﹝二﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":357,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":342,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
